        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIdtNJUEccogw04KkgKcl68xfwS76KufYLOV-PjKQWOMUVZMw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Josianne is a professional and well educated real estate agent, she has a calm and confident nature ,  shes very understanding and knowledgeable. She takes the time to really understand the clients needs.I would recommend her to everyone! Such a Joy to buy and sell with!",
        "time": 1705805584,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ritika Malini",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108462160378627256796/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWkPegvLBHhPOV26i7pE4w5xetRCsL5y9AVF_zjow5prXusTVQqgQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Josiane is the best! She was thorough and professional and great to work with. In the craziness of the current market where the houses are going for over-asking prices, she always guided us with the present worth of the property when placing an offer. She was highly communicative and easy to reach to answer any of our questions.  She kept us apprised about available appointments and always told us when a new one came on the market. Josiane is sincere, polite and very patient, as we visited houses with our young kids. Highly recommend!",
        "time": 1657268358,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Yasmine N",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111157655364307106329/reviews",
